{"amendments":[{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"id":"water-heater-sizing-01-basis","requirements":[{"id":"WATER01-MODEL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Model execution boundary","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Every candidate is executed with the approved wright-water-heater-v1@0.1.0 recorded Modelica kit and its accepted parameter schema; an analytical or Python substitute is not labeled as kit execution."},{"id":"WATER01-PHYSICS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/parameters.csv","locator":"water_mass through electrical_to_thermal_efficiency","sha256":"4d22025c16331782912713803c7b31504aa342c28b415815130785f5fbb2c28b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Supplied model quantities; Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"Runs use 0.350 kg water, 4180 J/(kg·K), 90 J/K vessel capacity, 20 °C initial/ambient temperature, UA=0.60 W/K and electrical-to-thermal efficiency 0.92 without silent substitution."},{"id":"WATER01-CONTROL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Constant electrical power is applied until the first 90 °C target crossing using the selected kit's declared 2 K hysteresis semantics; post-crossing energy is not counted as heat-up energy."},{"id":"WATER01-CANDIDATES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/power-candidates.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"bd6fb78377423bd5ea6cad311ed14cd1f1159333414caae20bcbd1c7621d665b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Comparison policy","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"The study retains actual results for all and only the declared P350, P500 and P700 electrical-power candidates."},{"id":"WATER01-HORIZON","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/parameters.csv","locator":"requested_stop_time,requested_output_interval","sha256":"4d22025c16331782912713803c7b31504aa342c28b415815130785f5fbb2c28b"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"Each baseline run uses the accepted 300 s horizon and 1 s output grid; the comparison records if a candidate does not reach 90 °C within that horizon."},{"id":"WATER01-TARGET","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/parameters.csv","locator":"target_temperature,heat_up_limit","sha256":"4d22025c16331782912713803c7b31504aa342c28b415815130785f5fbb2c28b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Business and design context","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"Candidate compliance uses the independently interpolated first 90 °C crossing and the inclusive 180 s heat-up limit."},{"id":"WATER01-SELECTION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/power-candidates.csv","locator":"selection_rule","sha256":"bd6fb78377423bd5ea6cad311ed14cd1f1159333414caae20bcbd1c7621d665b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Comparison policy","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"The recommendation selects the lowest declared electrical power that meets 180 s, or reports no feasible candidate without changing mass or the power menu."},{"id":"WATER01-ENERGY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"The report separates electrical input energy, thermal energy delivered to water/vessel, and modeled ambient loss over the declared target-crossing horizon."},{"id":"WATER01-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Requested outputs and initial validation","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"},{"artifact_ref":"specs/081-engineering-workflow-templates/dataset-campaign/modelica-selected-kit.md","locator":"Physical and numerical contract; Real result export and study analysis","sha256":"80d7746c5ef13d7198894f2ca7c112be95a1031fa794aa5e29b151f376d5cc56"}],"text":"The selected controlling candidate retains a separate refined run using the authorized tighter timestep/tolerance and reports target-time and final-energy sensitivity."},{"id":"WATER01-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"19061f48c1076342c0eaaa094be914d637f187f0efbf22fd600b13a8512ec40c"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Requested outputs and initial validation","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"The output set contains temperature-time.csv, power-comparison.csv, energy-summary.csv, temperature curves, heater-selection report, and kit-parameters.json with kit/version, accepted names, run IDs and integration settings."},{"id":"WATER01-CLAIM-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/water-heater-sizing/01-single-cup-countertop/context.md","locator":"Business and design context; Model execution boundary; Shared physical assumptions","sha256":"9a9e11da6dabf6b2d415f83376e9c262e99756082ceafd622859fbe4773dbc5d"}],"text":"The study remains a simulation decision and does not claim appliance safety, physical heater control, wiring approval, purchasing, measured hardware performance, boil/steam behavior, or closed-loop overshoot."}],"unresolved_decisions":[],"version":"1"}
